          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW212021522 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Which type of food is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW212021522 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;generally high&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW212021522 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; in dietary fiber?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
