      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW124041464 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; Which of the following types of food is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW124041464 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;generally recommended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW124041464 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; to limit in your diet?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
